"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/tbs-disco-apm-mounting-"
"suggestion>`__。注意TBS机架将两个前臂张开，使螺旋桨不干扰FPV，并允许相机轻松安装在前方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:94
#: 1af198a69b8b4e14b6eccb76e6ea55a1 749b43167c8e4176acc3a09cc1464190
#: b49d52d8a7814fc0840135473a9f11bb e5015f868d864b2ab131d64e8f64a13f
#: e9b068b0ddcb4e77ad18862d6fa663a8
msgid "Safety Warnings Relating Specifically to FPV Flight"
msgstr "与FPV飞行特别相关的安全警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:96
#: 0723cebe988647f59337050080b3f9cf 4a5c243b30c84a88840ce27d2deb59f6
#: 5542954c5b0d4a38bcc661d5768fb73d 5a8fdbb1a1b642008ba8c61503ae1804
#: b103ab6d6ab04282b8834c243109bd89
msgid ""
"Because of the limited field-of-view of the FPV camera you may not be able "
"to easily see obstacles near the vehicle which may be why the `Academy of "
"Model Aeronautics <https://www.modelaircraft.org/>`__ requires that there be"
" a second person acting as spotter for all FPV flights."
msgstr ""
"由于FPV相机的视野有限，您可能难以看清飞行器附近的障碍物，这可能就是 `美国航模协会 "
"<https://www.modelaircraft.org/>`__ 要求所有FPV飞行必须有第二人担任观察员的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:101
#: 1d0e3e89a3e74d1b97b07db01a32bdc2 42c35cfe2682447d996185af3f288a31
#: 5c36a840686c4f189604c54d76cb7fca 8ce220c1d2e04c2f879435d675654d5f
#: c978831c117740b293ef1c926d0571bb
msgid ""
"Be ready for loss of FPV video caused by flying beyond your FPV systems "
"limits or interference from structures between you and the vehicle. Being "
"able to invoke the vehicle's RTL mode is a worthwhile safety feature even "
"though most countries require FPV operation within line of sight of the "
"operator."
msgstr ""
"随时准备应对因飞出FPV系统范围或建筑物遮挡造成的FPV视频丢失。即使大多数国家要求FPV飞行在操作员视线范围内进行，能够触发飞行器RTL模式也是值得拥有的安全功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:104
#: 305378f4957e45a8a534a1d7753cf7b5 3a6c7342016047d9a4509ee3687c96ab
#: abfc8a731d3d46ff8d879f0215784ecc c2b99a1fcfc14d53871d5b4f9f46595c
#: fdc48d27bcdd4d7d9222b6d6292dc5e1
msgid ""
"Know and recognize the FPV signal loss warning signs and be ready to shed "
"the FPV equipment and retake line-of-sight control at all times."
msgstr "了解并识别FPV信号丢失的警告迹象，随时准备放弃FPV设备并重新进行目视控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:106
#: 0f1364ed9cbc40eaaf6a3eedd4dc3f64 15c39545bb07456fa2f10add00384662
#: 4cd863be1e1f4875bdc5542e6743c2a4 98bef951bdbb4d108cd12ea09e8d177a
#: 9db9a785e83445049152296563e9f16a
msgid ""
"FPV equipment can interfere with the vehicle's radio or GPS if placed too "
"close."
msgstr "FPV设备若放置过近，可能干扰飞行器的遥控或GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:110
#: 1a0a460494714c56bf54a28ab1c00801 4b9b4972c70c437688c0a900b6319653
#: 774a733ebbed4c3ab0139e33872ec588 c70c5318a362435a88282b931a28ba0b
#: e08373ae6c9d47f5baaedb761a5e283f
msgid "Government/Local Regulations"
msgstr "政府/地方法规"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:112
#: 4f80e4dc188944da87b0fb81c5c2c9cb 601188ad9c2b4035a8cf5de8e46d1c98
#: 6ee8effca75c45bc911a1e587b5d6bcd a838f113631a4337a7a70f1c907dfe01
#: f23530faed2b4e8781af29988d522300
msgid ""
"FPV flight regulations imposed by countries and localities vary greatly and "
"are constantly evolving. Be sure you know the applicable restrictions. Also,"
" be aware that FPV transmitters may have restrictions on frequency bands and"
" power that vary from country to country, as well as requirements for "
"licensing."
msgstr ""
"各国家和地区对 FPV 飞行的法规差异很大，且不断更新。请务必了解适用的限制规定。另请注意，FPV "
"发射机在频段和功率方面可能受到各国不同的限制，还可能需要持证上岗。"
